{"seq":3,"slug":"black-hole-formation","title":"恒星级黑洞形成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/stellar-physics/stellar-endpoints/black-hole-formation","wordCount":2694,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"恒星级黑洞形成\">恒星级黑洞形成</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>恒星级黑洞的形成与性质围绕以下核心概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>坍缩触发</strong>：铁核超过有效钱德拉塞卡极限后，光致蜕变与电子俘获移除热压与简并压支撑，核心自由落体坍缩</li>\n<li><strong>两种终态路径</strong>：激波成功 → 超新星 + 中子星；激波停滞或直接坍缩 → 黑洞（含&quot;失败超新星&quot;）</li>\n<li><strong>对不稳定与质量间隙</strong>：极大质量恒星的对产生导致 50–130 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mo>⊙</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M_\\odot</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8917em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2583em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">⊙</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的&quot;上质量间隙&quot;，130–250 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mo>⊙</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M_\\odot</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8917em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2583em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">⊙</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 完全瓦解不留残骸</li>\n<li><strong>Kerr 几何</strong>：无毛定理下黑洞由质量、自旋决定，Schwarzschild 半径 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>G</mi><mi>M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_s=2GM/c^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">GM</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与 ISCO 半径决定吸积盘内边界与辐射效率</li>\n<li><strong>探测手段</strong>：X 射线双星、引力波并合、微透镜与天体测量四条通道共同勾勒恒星级黑洞族群</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"恒星级黑洞概述\">恒星级黑洞概述</h2><p>恒星级黑洞（Stellar-mass Black Hole）是大质量恒星演化终点的一种可能产物，质量范围约3–100 M☉。当恒星核心在演化末期坍缩，且残骸质量超过中子星的TOV极限（~2.2–2.5 M☉）时，没有任何已知的物理力能够阻止引力坍缩的继续——物质被压缩到无限小的体积，形成时空奇点，外部被事件视界包裹。</p>\n<h2 id=\"黑洞形成的物理过程\">黑洞形成的物理过程</h2><h3 id=\"核坍缩与超新星机制\">核坍缩与超新星机制</h3><p>大质量恒星核心经历多阶段核燃烧后形成铁核。铁的比结合能最高，无法通过进一步聚变释放能量。当铁核质量超过有效钱德拉塞卡极限（~1.2–1.5 M☉，考虑有限温度和中子化效应）时：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><p><strong>光致蜕变</strong>（Photodisintegration）：高能光子分解铁核为α粒子和中子 $<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mn>56</mn></msup><mtext>Fe</mtext><mo>+</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>13</mn><msup><mo>⋅</mo><mn>4</mn></msup><mtext>He</mtext><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">^{56}\\text{Fe} + \\gamma \\rightarrow 13 \\cdot ^4\\text{He} + 4n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8974em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">56</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Fe</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">13</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\"><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">He</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>$ 每次反应吸收 ~124 MeV，移除热压支撑</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>电子俘获</strong>（Electron Capture）：自由电子被质子俘获 $<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mo>−</mo></msup><mo>→</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>ν</mi><mi>e</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p + e^- \\rightarrow n + \\nu_e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0637em;\">ν</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0637em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>$ 移除电子简并压，产生中微子</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>核心自由落体坍缩</strong>：内核在约0.5秒内从地球大小坍缩到~50 km坍缩速度可达 ~0.25c</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>核心反弹</strong>（Bounce）：内核密度达到核密度时，强核力排斥阻止进一步压缩，形成向外激波</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>激波传播与命运</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>激波成功穿过外层 → 超新星爆发 → 中子星残骸</li>\n<li>激波失败（stalled shock）→ 物质回落 → 黑洞形成</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[铁核超过有效&lt;br/&gt;钱德拉塞卡极限] --&gt; B[光致蜕变 + 电子俘获]&#10;    B --&gt; C[核心自由落体坍缩&lt;br/&gt;~0.5秒]&#10;    C --&gt; D[核密度反弹&lt;br/&gt;形成激波]&#10;    D --&gt; E{激波能否&lt;br/&gt;穿过外层?}&#10;    E --&gt;|是| F[超新星爆发&lt;br/&gt;Type II/Ib/Ic]&#10;    F --&gt; G[中子星残骸]&#10;    E --&gt;|否| H[激波停滞&lt;br/&gt;物质回落]&#10;    H --&gt; I[中子星暂态&lt;br/&gt;吸积增长]&#10;    I --&gt; J{总质量 &gt; TOV极限?}&#10;    J --&gt;|是| K[坍缩为黑洞]&#10;    J --&gt;|否| L[大质量中子星]\">graph TD\n    A[铁核超过有效&lt;br/&gt;钱德拉塞卡极限] --&gt; B[光致蜕变 + 电子俘获]\n    B --&gt; C[核心自由落体坍缩&lt;br/&gt;~0.5秒]\n    C --&gt; D[核密度反弹&lt;br/&gt;形成激波]\n    D --&gt; E{激波能否&lt;br/&gt;穿过外层?}\n    E --&gt;|是| F[超新星爆发&lt;br/&gt;Type II/Ib/Ic]\n    F --&gt; G[中子星残骸]\n    E --&gt;|否| H[激波停滞&lt;br/&gt;物质回落]\n    H --&gt; I[中子星暂态&lt;br/&gt;吸积增长]\n    I --&gt; J{总质量 &gt; TOV极限?}\n    J --&gt;|是| K[坍缩为黑洞]\n    J --&gt;|否| L[大质量中子星]</pre><h3 id=\"直接坍缩机制-direct-collapse\">直接坍缩机制（Direct Collapse）</h3><p>理论预测，对于最大质量的恒星（M &gt; 40 M☉），核心坍缩后激波根本无法形成有效爆发——大部分包层物质直接落入新形成的黑洞。这种&quot;失败超新星&quot;（Failed Supernova）路径长期缺乏直接观测证据。</p>\n<p><strong>2026年的突破性发现</strong>：加州理工学院团队报告了恒星M31-2014-DS1直接坍缩为黑洞的完整观测。该恒星位于仙女座星系（距地球250万光年），通过2005–2023年的多波段监测发现：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>2014年起红外异常增亮</li>\n<li>2016年亮度急剧下降（不到一年内）</li>\n<li>2022–2023年可见光/近红外亮度降至原先的万分之一</li>\n<li>中红外仅余十分之一的微弱信号</li>\n</ul>\n<p>研究揭示的关键物理：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>仅约1%的恒星包层物质最终落入黑洞</li>\n<li>外层对流运动阻碍物质直接坠入</li>\n<li>内层物质沿黑洞外围缓慢旋入</li>\n<li>大部分包层在长时间尺度上缓慢耗散</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这是人类首次直接观测到恒星&quot;安静死亡&quot;而非超新星爆炸的完整过程。</p>\n<h3 id=\"对不稳定超新星-pair-instability-supernova\">对不稳定超新星（Pair-Instability Supernova）</h3><p>对于极大质量恒星（130–250 M☉），核心温度极高，高能光子产生正负电子对：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo>→</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mo>−</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma + \\gamma \\rightarrow e^+ + e^-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9047em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8213em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8213em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8213em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>对产生消耗辐射压支撑，触发核心坍缩。但随后的热核爆炸能量远超引力束缚能——恒星<strong>完全瓦解</strong>，不留下任何残骸。</p>\n<p>这预测了一个<strong>黑洞质量间隙</strong>：约50–130 M☉ 范围内不应存在恒星直接坍缩形成的黑洞。</p>\n<h3 id=\"脉动对不稳定超新星-ppisn\">脉动对不稳定超新星（PPISN）</h3><p>在质量范围 50–130 M☉ 之间，对不稳定不足以完全瓦解恒星，但会触发多次脉动性质量抛射，最终残骸质量被限制在约 40–50 M☉ 以下。</p>\n<h2 id=\"黑洞的基本物理性质\">黑洞的基本物理性质</h2><h3 id=\"kerr-黑洞参数\">Kerr 黑洞参数</h3><p>天体物理黑洞由&quot;无毛定理&quot;描述——完全由三个参数决定：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>符号</th>\n<th>恒星级黑洞典型范围</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>质量</td>\n<td>M</td>\n<td>3–100 M☉</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>角动量（自旋）</td>\n<td>a* = J/(GM²/c)</td>\n<td>0–0.998</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>电荷</td>\n<td>Q</td>\n<td>天体物理中可忽略</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Schwarzschild 半径（非旋转黑洞事件视界）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>G</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2.95</mn><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mi>M</mi><msub><mi>M</mi><mo>⊙</mo></msub></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mtext> km</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_s = \\frac{2GM}{c^2} = 2.95 \\left(\\frac{M}{M_\\odot}\\right) \\text{ km}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">GM</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.95</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2583em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">⊙</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8943em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> km</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>Kerr 黑洞的视界半径：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mo>∗</mo><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></msqrt><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_+ = \\frac{R_s}{2}\\left(1 + \\sqrt{1 - a_*^2}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2583em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9804em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3.2em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1em;\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.9404em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:1.28em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.28em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1296\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><