span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">GM</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>极端Kerr黑洞（a* = 1, 顺行）：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>I</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>O</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>G</mi><mi>M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_{ISCO} = GM/c^2 = R_s/2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">GM</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/2</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>ISCO以内的物质不可避免地螺旋落入黑洞。ISCO半径决定了吸积盘的内边界和最大辐射效率（6%–42%）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"恒星级黑洞的观测探测\">恒星级黑洞的观测探测</h2><h3 id=\"x射线双星中的黑洞\">X射线双星中的黑洞</h3><p>最早确认的恒星级黑洞候选体来自X射线双星系统：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>系统</th>\n<th>黑洞质量</th>\n<th>伴星类型</th>\n<th>发现意义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Cygnus X-1</td>\n<td>~21 M☉</td>\n<td>O型超巨星</td>\n<td>首个确认的黑洞候选体（1971）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>A0620-00</td>\n<td>~6.6 M☉</td>\n<td>K型矮星</td>\n<td>质量函数最精确</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GRS 1915+105</td>\n<td>~14 M☉</td>\n<td>K型巨星</td>\n<td>首个超光速喷流源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>V404 Cygni</td>\n<td>~9 M☉</td>\n<td>K型巨星</td>\n<td>反复X射线爆发</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>黑洞确认的判据：致密天体的质量超过中子星上限（~3 M☉），且没有固体表面的观测证据（无I型X射线暴）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"引力波探测\">引力波探测</h3><p>2015年LIGO首次直接探测到双黑洞并合的引力波信号（GW150914），开启了黑洞观测的新时代：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>事件</th>\n<th>黑洞质量</th>\n<th>并合后质量</th>\n<th>突破性意义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>GW150914</td>\n<td>36+29 M☉</td>\n<td>62 M☉</td>\n<td>首次引力波直接探测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GW190521</td>\n<td>85+66 M☉</td>\n<td>142 M☉</td>\n<td>首个中等质量黑洞</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GW200105</td>\n<td>BH 8.9 + NS 1.9 M☉</td>\n<td>~11 M☉</td>\n<td>首个NS-BH并合确认</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[恒星级黑洞探测方法] --&gt; B[X射线双星&lt;br/&gt;吸积盘辐射]&#10;    A --&gt; C[引力波&lt;br/&gt;并合事件]&#10;    A --&gt; D[微透镜&lt;br/&gt;孤立黑洞]&#10;    A --&gt; E[天体测量&lt;br/&gt;非发光伴星]&#10;    B --&gt; F[已确认~20个系统]&#10;    C --&gt; G[LIGO/Virgo/KAGRA&lt;br/&gt;~90+并合事件]&#10;    D --&gt; H[Gaia-BH1/2/3&lt;br/&gt;近邻孤立黑洞]&#10;    E --&gt; I[Gaia DR3候选体&lt;br/&gt;大规模统计]\">graph LR\n    A[恒星级黑洞探测方法] --&gt; B[X射线双星&lt;br/&gt;吸积盘辐射]\n    A --&gt; C[引力波&lt;br/&gt;并合事件]\n    A --&gt; D[微透镜&lt;br/&gt;孤立黑洞]\n    A --&gt; E[天体测量&lt;br/&gt;非发光伴星]\n    B --&gt; F[已确认~20个系统]\n    C --&gt; G[LIGO/Virgo/KAGRA&lt;br/&gt;~90+并合事件]\n    D --&gt; H[Gaia-BH1/2/3&lt;br/&gt;近邻孤立黑洞]\n    E --&gt; I[Gaia DR3候选体&lt;br/&gt;大规模统计]</pre><h3 id=\"gaia-发现的休眠黑洞\">Gaia 发现的休眠黑洞</h3><p>2022–2024年，Gaia天体测量卫星通过伴星轨道运动发现了多个&quot;休眠&quot;黑洞（非吸积态）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Gaia-BH1</strong>：距地球1560光年，M_BH ≈ 9.6 M☉，伴星为G型主序星</li>\n<li><strong>Gaia-BH2</strong>：距地球3800光年，M_BH ≈ 8.9 M☉，伴星为红巨星</li>\n<li><strong>Gaia-BH3</strong>：距地球2000光年，M_BH ≈ 33 M☉——银河系内已知最大恒星级黑洞</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这些发现表明银河系中存在大量不发光的休眠黑洞，估计总数约10⁸–10⁹个。</p>\n<h2 id=\"质量间隙问题\">质量间隙问题</h2><p>观测上存在两个&quot;质量间隙&quot;问题：</p>\n<h3 id=\"下质量间隙-lower-mass-gap\">下质量间隙（Lower Mass Gap）</h3><p>中子星最大质量（~2.5 M☉）与已确认最轻黑洞（~5 M☉）之间的3–5 M☉区域，长期缺乏致密天体。可能原因：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>超新星机制的固有偏好</li>\n<li>观测选择效应</li>\n<li>2019年后LIGO数据开始填补此区间</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"上质量间隙-upper-mass-gap\">上质量间隙（Upper Mass Gap）</h3><p>对不稳定超新星理论预测的 ~50–130 M☉ 间隙。GW190521事件中 85 M☉ 的黑洞位于此区间，可能来自：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>多次并合的层级产物</li>\n<li>低金属丰度环境中对不稳定边界的偏移</li>\n<li>稠密星团中的动力学形成</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"黑洞自旋的测量\">黑洞自旋的测量</h2><p>恒星级黑洞的自旋提供了形成机制的关键信息：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>测量方法</th>\n<th>物理原理</th>\n<th>精度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>X射线铁Kα线</td>\n<td>吸积盘内缘引力红移</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>热连续谱拟合</td>\n<td>ISCO半径与自旋的关系</td>\n<td>较高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>引力波相位</td>\n<td>自旋-轨道耦合效应</td>\n<td>低（单个事件）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>准周期振荡</td>\n<td>黑洞附近轨道频率</td>\n<td>模型依赖</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>引力波观测显示双黑洞系统中黑洞自旋往往较低且方向随机——支持动力学形成渠道（在稠密星团中俘获配对），而非共同演化的孤立双星渠道。</p>\n<h2 id=\"最新研究进展\">最新研究进展</h2><h3 id=\"恒星直接坍缩的首次完整观测-2026年2月\">恒星直接坍缩的首次完整观测（2026年2月）</h3><p>如前述，M31-2014-DS1的观测标志着&quot;失败超新星&quot;假说得到直接验证。研究团队估算约20–30%的大质量恒星可能通过此途径形成黑洞，而非经历壮观的超新星爆发。这一比例对星系化学演化模型有重要影响——直接坍缩意味着重元素被锁在黑洞中而非散布到星际介质。</p>\n<h3 id=\"黑洞-中子星椭圆轨道并合-2026年3月\">黑洞-中子星椭圆轨道并合（2026年3月）</h3><p>伯明翰大学等团队对GW200105的重新分析发现该系统在并合前为椭圆轨道（离心率显著非零，99.5%置信度）。这是中子星-黑洞并合中首次确认的椭圆轨道，强烈暗示该系统形成于稠密恒星环境中的三体相互作用，而非标准的共包层演化。</p>\n<h3 id=\"ligo-virgo-kagra-o4观测运行\">LIGO-Virgo-KAGRA O4观测运行</h3><p>第四次观测运行（O4，2023–2025）预计探测到数百个致密天体并合事件。初步结果显示：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>恒星级黑洞质量分布在 ~8 M☉ 和 ~35 M☉ 处存在结构（可能的峰值）</li>\n<li>下质量间隙中确认了多个3–5 M☉ 的致密天体</li>\n<li>黑洞自旋分布的总体特征更加清晰：多数有效自旋较小但非零</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>恒星级黑洞形成于大质量恒星演化末期：铁核超过有效钱德拉塞卡极限后，光致蜕变与电子俘获移除支撑，核心自由落体坍缩，激波成功则留下中子星，激波停滞或直接坍缩则形成黑洞。</li>\n<li>对不稳定超新星理论预测了 50–130 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mo>⊙</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M_\\odot</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8917em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2583em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">⊙</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的上质量间隙（PPISN 把残骸限制在约 40–50 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mo>⊙</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M_\\odot</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8917em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2583em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">⊙</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 以下），而 130–250 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mo>⊙</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M_\\odot</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8917em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2583em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">⊙</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的恒星完全瓦解、不留残骸。</li>\n<li>天体物理黑洞由无毛定理仅用质量与自旋描述；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>G</mi><mi>M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_s=2GM/c^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">GM</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与 ISCO 半径决定吸积盘内边界和 6%–42% 的辐射效率。</li>\n<li>黑洞的探测依赖四条互补通道——X 射线双星（Cygnus X-1 起）、引力波并合（GW150914 起）、微透镜与 Gaia 天体测量发现的休眠黑洞——它们共同揭示银河系中约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>8</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">8</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>–<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>9</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^9</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">9</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 个不发光黑洞。</li>\n<li>下/上质量间隙、自旋分布与椭圆轨道并合等观测，正把恒星级黑洞的族群特征与形成通道（孤立演化 vs. 动力学形成）逐步厘清。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"恒星级黑洞形成","id":"恒星级黑洞形成"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"恒星级黑洞概述","id":"恒星级黑洞概述"},{"level":2,"text":"黑洞形成的物理过程","id":"黑洞形成的物理过程"},{"level":3,"text":"核坍缩与超新星机制","id":"核坍缩与超新星机制"},{"level":3,"text":"直接坍缩机制（Direct Collapse）","id":"直接坍缩机制-direct-collapse"},{"level":3,"text":"对不稳定超新星（Pair-Instability Supernova）","id":"对不稳定超新星-pair-instability-supernova"},{"level":3,"text":"脉动对不稳定超新星（PPISN）","id":"脉动对不稳定超新星-ppisn"},{"level":2,"text":"黑洞的基本物理性质","id":"黑洞的基本物理性质"},{"level":3,"text":"Kerr 黑洞参数","id":"kerr-黑洞参数"},{"level":3,"text":"最内稳定圆轨道（ISCO）","id":"最内稳定圆轨道-isco"},{"level":2,"text":"恒星级黑洞的观测探测","id":"恒星级黑洞的观测探测"},{"level":3,"text":"X射线双星中的黑洞","id":"x射线双星中的黑洞"},{"level":3,"text":"引力波探测","id":"引力波探测"},{"level":3,"text":"Gaia 发现的休眠黑洞","id":"gaia-发现的休眠黑洞"},{"level":2,"text":"质量间隙问题","id":"质量间隙问题"},{"level":3,"text":"下质量间隙（Lower Mass Gap）","id":"下质量间隙-lower-mass-gap"},{"level":3,"text":"上质量间隙（Upper Mass Gap）","id":"上